{"slug":"appcues","name":"Appcues","description":"Appcues is a powerful user onboarding and product adoption platform offering multi-channel messaging and actionable insights. It integrates in-app experiences, emails, and push notifications, customized to your brand, to create tailored, automated journeys that boost engagement. With no-code user tracking and activity-based triggers, Appcues ensures precise, timely communication. Detailed insights and reporting tools help measure message performance, track trends, and optimize engagement through A/B testing, improving key metrics like activation and retention.","icon":"https://stuff.thingsofbrand.com/appcues.com/images/img68e320ee03_appcues.jpg","domain":"appcues.com","rank":1879,"labels":["Product Management","Communication"],"categories":["project-management","communication"],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"When one or more flows are created","d":"Runs the workflow automatically whenever one or more flows are created within the specified number of minutes.","t":"trigger","k":"polling"},{"n":"New Segment","d":"Fetch segments created within the specified number of minutes.","t":"trigger","k":"polling"},{"n":"Update Segment","d":"Change the name and/or description of an existing segment using its segment ID.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Segment","d":"Creates a new segment.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Publish a Flow","d":"Publish the specified Appcues flow to make it live for the account.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Update a Group Profile","d":"Updates the profile attributes for the selected group.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Update User Profile","d":"Update a user's profile attributes.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Send User Event","d":"Send a user event to Appcues to record a user action, attributes, group, and timestamp.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"New Checklist","d":"Retrieve checklists created within the specified recent time window for the connected Appcues account.","t":"trigger","k":"polling"},{"n":"When a banner is created","d":"Runs the workflow automatically whenever a banner is created in the connected account within the specified number of minutes.","t":"trigger","k":"polling"},{"n":"List Flows","d":"Fetch all flows or a specific flow; filter by published state and choose response fields.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Segments","d":"Retrieve all segments or a specific segment; filter by name and choose which fields to return.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Tags","d":"Retrieve tags for the account; optionally fetch a specific tag, filter by name, or select response fields.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Pins","d":"List pins for the connected account; optionally fetch a specific pin, filter by published status, or select response fields.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Launchpads","d":"Get launchpads for the connected account. Fetch all or one, filter by published status, or pick response fields.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Banners","d":"Retrieve one or all banners; fetch by name or ID, filter by published status, and select response fields.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Checklists","d":"Retrieve one or all Appcues checklists; choose a specific checklist, filter by status or name, and select fields.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Publish Checklist","d":"Make a checklist live and available to users.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Publish Banners","d":"Publish the selected Appcues banner to make it active for users.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"When a new mobile experience is created","d":"Runs the workflow automatically whenever a new mobile experience is created in the connected Appcues account within the configured time window.","t":"trigger","k":"polling"},{"n":"Add/Remove User Segment","d":"Add or remove users from a selected Appcues segment.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Publish/Unpublish Experience","d":"Publish or unpublish the selected Appcues experience.","t":"action","k":"hook"}],"rec